cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use irshape, please cite the software and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "irshape: a coverage-shape-aware intron retention engine"
abstract: >
  irshape quantifies intron retention from per-base coverage and splice-junction
  counts alone, without read-level access, applying a corrected intronic mask and
  a per-length-tier coverage-shape layer on top of the IRFinder principle.
type: software
version: 1.0.1
date-released: "2026-08-26"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AIGeneRegulation/irshape"
authors:
